    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is survival in the cards?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter</strong> is an episodic murder-mystery ADV cardbattler that lovingly fuses retro anime analog horror with Danganronpa, coming to Steam Early Access in 2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>The Empire of Japan, 1986...\u00a0</strong>Awoken in a decaying old bunker, sixteen elite <strong>Absolute Students</strong> are trapped in a kill-or-be-killed <strong>Apathy Experiment</strong>. Will they band together to uncover secrets of this anemoic alternate past, or lose their humanity and\u00a0lives in the present?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a visual style inspired by Rumiko Takahashi and classic Japanese mystery-adventure games, <strong>Kumitantei\u2122</strong>\u00a0thrusts you into a suspenseful character-driven death game narrative where your deckbuilding and detective skills are the only keys to surviving. It's a creepy-cute love letter to decades of ADVs that wears its many inspirations on its sleeve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/5b26f92f744ae5eb1155c533bbbd8401.avif?t=1755204688\" width=1600 height=865 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond during Free Time!\u00a0</strong>Get to know your classmates by listening to them, giving them gifts, and receive unique powerful cards to use during a Card Battle Debate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate grisly crime scenes!</strong> Use your detective skills to comb through murdered classmates\u2019 crime scenes and take your evidence to trial!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Clinical Trial!\u00a0</strong>Cut through lies and deception with a War of Words and one-on-one Card Battle Debates to uncover the truth! These\u00a0high stakes, high energy Clinical Trials can only end in bloodshed, whether it's the culprit's or <u>everyone else's!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your deck!\u00a0</strong>Create absolute combos using cards you find in the Bunker and through bonding with your classmates to dominate the Clinical Trials!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Prizes with the Kitty Catcher!</strong> Easily bond with your new friends by giving them personalized gifts from the definitely-not-rigged Kitty Catcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please insert coin!\u00a0</strong>Test your retro gaming skills in a variety of faithfully crafted anemoic riffs on true old-school arcade icons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/c79a39c1d9bae5879267bc3e78dd5b06.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is survival in the cards?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter</strong> is an episodic murder-mystery ADV cardbattler that lovingly fuses retro anime analog horror with Danganronpa, coming to Steam Early Access in 2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>The Empire of Japan, 1986...\u00a0</strong>Awoken in a decaying old bunker, sixteen elite <strong>Absolute Students</strong> are trapped in a kill-or-be-killed <strong>Apathy Experiment</strong>. Will they band together to uncover secrets of this anemoic alternate past, or lose their humanity and\u00a0lives in the present?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a visual style inspired by Rumiko Takahashi and classic Japanese mystery-adventure games, <strong>Kumitantei\u2122</strong>\u00a0thrusts you into a suspenseful character-driven death game narrative where your deckbuilding and detective skills are the only keys to surviving. It's a creepy-cute love letter to decades of ADVs that wears its many inspirations on its sleeve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/5b26f92f744ae5eb1155c533bbbd8401.avif?t=1755204688\" width=1600 height=865 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond during Free Time!\u00a0</strong>Get to know your classmates by listening to them, giving them gifts, and receive unique powerful cards to use during a Card Battle Debate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate grisly crime scenes!</strong> Use your detective skills to comb through murdered classmates\u2019 crime scenes and take your evidence to trial!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Clinical Trial!\u00a0</strong>Cut through lies and deception with a War of Words and one-on-one Card Battle Debates to uncover the truth! These\u00a0high stakes, high energy Clinical Trials can only end in bloodshed, whether it's the culprit's or <u>everyone else's!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your deck!\u00a0</strong>Create absolute combos using cards you find in the Bunker and through bonding with your classmates to dominate the Clinical Trials!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Prizes with the Kitty Catcher!</strong> Easily bond with your new friends by giving them personalized gifts from the definitely-not-rigged Kitty Catcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please insert coin!\u00a0</strong>Test your retro gaming skills in a variety of faithfully crafted anemoic riffs on true old-school arcade icons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/30bf3fc66c00216042adc592c4dbaa10.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.poster.avif?t=1755204688\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.webm?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759280/extras/fd08f324c83565620024735d7f990baf.mp4?t=1755204688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Janus Institute's Class of '89 are trapped and forced to kill each other 'for science', is survival in the cards? Kumitantei\u2122: Old-School Slaughter is an episodic murder-mystery ADV card-battler that lovingly fuses retro anime and Danganronpa!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
